      "message": "[warning] Line 63: 🟡 Section headers are represented as `null` by `ConversationList`, and `SmartListDiffUtil.areContentsTheSame` compares those nulls as identical. When a filtered list changes from only direct conversations to groups plus conversations (or vice versa), the header at position 0 changes from `Conversations` to `Groups` but DiffUtil will not rebind it, leaving a stale title. Compare header titles in the diff or force header rebinds when section metadata changes.",
