      "message": "[error] Line 166: 🔴 `moveFile` returns `false` when the source cannot be moved (for example, a full/unwritable destination), but the result is ignored and `sendFileAwait` is still called with a nonexistent destination. If the native call returns without throwing, the broadcast completes and shows `channels_message_sent` even though no attachment was enqueued. Check the return value and return a `Completable.error(...)` (and clean up any partial destination) before calling the daemon.",
